{"version":1,"content":"<p>在關鍵基礎設施面臨日益增多的外國威脅之際，英國與挪威擬議中的數字走廊項目正在開展可行性研究。英國已表示支持在設得蘭羣島與挪威之間鋪設一條新的海底數據電纜，稱這一項目將有助於增強國家韌性，應對外國勢力對關鍵基礎設施日益增長的威脅。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585776.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.949726+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:06:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"e32dc8991beb5f29136913bdfa81b5bad0835db6e7b218024d0b473d5e94f85c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}